{"id":"80c765fb7376d531","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-gl-conservative.md","title":"GL Conservative over the Box-Free Fragment","display":"cor-gl-conservative — GL Conservative over the Box-Free Fragment","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-gl-conservative","aliases":["89-cor-gl-conservative"],"display":"cor-gl-conservative — GL Conservative over the Box-Free Fragment","depends_on":["[[89-thm-gl-consistency]]","[[89-df-box-free-fragment]]","[[89-df-propositional-tautology]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-gl-conservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-gl-conservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-gl-conservative — GL Conservative over the Box-Free Fragment"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"12a315bba5062a88\" href=\"?note=12a315bba5062a88\" title=\"89-thm-gl-consistency\">89-thm-gl-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c78885ae02bfb25f\" href=\"?note=c78885ae02bfb25f\" title=\"89-df-box-free-fragment\">89-df-box-free-fragment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"81d2de5abb2876b6\" href=\"?note=81d2de5abb2876b6\" title=\"89-df-propositional-tautology\">89-df-propositional-tautology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_0\\)</span> 为无盒片段，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\)</span> 为模态语言命题重言式集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 是去盒函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为 GL 定理集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gl\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GL}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_0=\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gl\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GL}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_0=\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 11；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>若无盒公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是 GL 定理，去盒一致性定理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e(A)\">\\(e(A)\\)</span> 为重言式。按结构归纳，无盒时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e(A)=A\">\\(e(A)=A\\)</span>，得到左含右。反向直接由 K 的公理包含全部重言式以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm K\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm K\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>。这里只对指定无盒片段断言保守性，不对任意模态片段或全部 K4 作同一断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-gl-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"12a315bba5062a88","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-free-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"c78885ae02bfb25f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-free-fragment]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-propositional-tautology","status":"resolved","id":"81d2de5abb2876b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-propositional-tautology]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gl\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GL}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_0=\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_0.","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"e(A)","display":false},{"tex":"e(A)=A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm K\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}","display":false}],"bytes":1193,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-555","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-cor-gl-conservative]]"}],"outgoing":["12a315bba5062a88","c78885ae02bfb25f","81d2de5abb2876b6","0006800fa1c85177"]}